{'symbol': 'CCI', 'date': '2023-06-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'BETTERINVESTING™ MAGAZINE UPDATE ON CROWN CASTLE INTERNATIONAL CORP. AND KINDER MORGAN INC.', 'text': 'TROY, MICH., JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE EDITORIAL ADVISORY AND SECURITIES REVIEW COMMITTEE OF BETTERINVESTING MAGAZINE TODAY ANNOUNCED CROWN CASTLE INTERNATIONAL CORP. (NYSE: CCI) AS ITS "STOCK TO STUDY" AND KINDER MORGAN INC.\xa0(NYSE: KMI) AS ITS "UNDERVALUED STOCK" IN THE SEPTEMBER 2023 ISSUE FOR INVESTORS\' INFORMATIONAL AND EDUCATIONAL USE.'}